{"path":"io/basic_fstream/is_open","title":"std::basic_fstream<CharT,Traits>::is_open","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::basic_fstream&lt;CharT,Traits&gt;::</span>is_open","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/io/basic_fstream/is_open","section":"io","kind":"page","summary":"Checks if the file stream has an associated file.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl\">\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\"> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">bool</span> is_open<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Checks if the file stream has an associated file.\n</p><p>Effectively calls <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_filebuf/is_open\"><code>rdbuf()-&gt;is_open()</code></a>. \n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<p>(none)\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p><code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw2\">true</span></span></code> if the file stream has an associated file, <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw2\">false</span></span></code> otherwise.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;fstream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;string&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/string/basic_string\"><span class=\"kw1238\">std::<span class=\"me2\">string</span></span></a> filename <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"some_file\"</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_fstream\"><span class=\"kw1751\">std::<span class=\"me2\">fstream</span></span></a> fs<span class=\"br0\">(</span>filename, std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">ios</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">in</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/manip/boolalpha\"><span class=\"kw1781\">std::<span class=\"me2\">boolalpha</span></span></a><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"fs.is_open() = \"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> fs.<span class=\"me1\">is_open</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <span class=\"kw1\">if</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"sy3\">!</span>fs.<span class=\"me1\">is_open</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n        fs.<span class=\"me1\">clear</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n        fs.<span class=\"me1\">open</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>filename, std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">ios</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">out</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n        <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"fs.is_open() = \"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> fs.<span class=\"me1\">is_open</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"br0\">}</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Possible output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>fs.is_open() = false\nfs.is_open() = true</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"Defect_reports\">Defect reports</h3>\n<p>The following behavior-changing defect reports were applied retroactively to previously published C++ standards.\n</p>\n<table class=\"dsctable\">\n<tr>\n<th>DR\n</th>\n<th>Applied to\n</th>\n<th>Behavior as published\n</th>\n<th>Correct behavior\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cplusplus.github.io/LWG/issue365\" data-external=\"1\">LWG 365</a>\n</td>\n<td>C++98\n</td>\n<td><code>is_open</code> was not declared with <span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">const</span></span> qualifier\n</td>\n<td>declared with <span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">const</span></span> qualifier\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_fstream/open\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>open</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  opens a file and associates it with the stream <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_fstream/close\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>close</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  closes the associated file <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"Defect reports","id":"Defect_reports"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"io","title":"Input/output library"},{"path":"io/basic_fstream","title":"std::basic_fstream"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::basic_fstream<CharT,Traits>::is_open","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration. Checks if the file stream has an associated file."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"(none)"},{"label":"Return value","note":"true if the file stream has an associated file, false otherwise."},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"open","note":"opens a file and associates it with the stream"},{"label":"close","note":"closes the associated file"}]}]},"standards":[],"wordCount":144,"codeBlockCount":2}
